+# per-target broker apply queue) — harness-only; all ATM pins read-only. Same E4 config and pre-registered seeds as r3/r4.
+# Arms (interleaved per run, same session/machine; harness --steward-apply-lock off everywhere):
+#   old = ATM 5692474f | fix = ATM bea35380 | opt = ATM 2118bc66
+#   q   = ATM 37847584, ATM_STEWARD_APPLY_QUEUE=on  (MAIN r5 arm = ATM defaults, set explicitly)
+#   nq  = ATM 37847584, ATM_STEWARD_APPLY_QUEUE=off (queue ablation)
+#   qr0 = ATM 37847584, queue on, ATM_STEWARD_RECOMPOSE_POLICY={"maxRecomposeAttempts":0}                      (recompose ablation)
